{"seq":3,"slug":"sociology","title":"社会学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology","introMarkdown":"# 社会学 简介\n\n社会学以系统的方法研究人类社会的结构、过程与变迁，帮助我们看到个人经历背后的社会力量。为什么有些人获得更多机会而另一些人被排斥在外？城市化如何改变人际关系？技术革命怎样重塑社会分层？社会学提供的不是简单答案，而是一种将个人处境置于社会结构中加以理解的思维方式。\n\n本知识体系从经典理论到当代视角，从宏观结构到微观方法，再延伸到社会学在具体领域的应用，为自学者构建兼具理论深度和研究能力的社会学基础。\n\n第一章**社会学理论**梳理从马克思、韦伯、涂尔干的奠基之作到帕森斯结构功能主义，再到布迪厄、吉登斯等当代理论家的核心贡献，展示社会学家如何用不同的概念框架解释社会运行。\n\n第二章**社会结构**聚焦社会分层与不平等的机制、家庭和教育等基本制度的功能与演变，以及城市化进程中社会关系的重组，帮助自学者理解社会秩序的骨架。\n\n第三章**社会研究方法**介绍质性研究的深度访谈与民族志、量化研究的问卷设计与统计分析，以及混合方法的设计策略，为自学者提供从观察到论证的完整研究工具链。\n\n第四章**应用社会学**将理论和方法带入教育社会学、医学社会学和数字社会学等前沿交叉领域，展示社会学视角如何为教育公平、健康政策和数字社会治理提供独特洞见。\n\n建议自学者先沉浸于理论章节建立\"社会学想象力\"，再学习研究方法获得分析手段，之后在社会结构和应用领域中选择感兴趣的方向深入。阅读经典社会学研究报告与当代田野调查会极大丰富学习体验。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sociological-theory","title":"社会学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/sociological-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-sociology","title":"古典社会学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/sociological-theory/classical-sociology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-sociological-theory","title":"现代社会学理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/sociological-theory/modern-sociological-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-perspectives","title":"当代视角","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/sociological-theory/contemporary-perspectives"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-structure","title":"社会结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/social-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-stratification","title":"社会分层","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/social-structure/social-stratification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-institutions","title":"社会制度","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/social-structure/social-institutions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"urbanization","title":"城市化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/social-structure/urbanization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"research-methods","title":"社会研究方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/research-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"qualitative-research","title":"质性研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/research-methods/qualitative-research"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantitative-research","title":"量化研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/research-methods/quantitative-research"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mixed-methods","title":"混合方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/research-methods/mixed-methods"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applied-sociology","title":"应用社会学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/applied-sociology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sociology-of-education","title":"教育社会学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/applied-sociology/sociology-of-education"},{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-sociology","title":"医学社会学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/applied-sociology/medical-sociology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-sociology","title":"数字社会学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/sociology/applied-sociology/digital-sociology"}]}]}